Description: high-performance web accelerator (matrix build)
 Varnish Cache is a high-performance HTTP accelerator. This package includes
 a systemd service based on the official Varnish package integration.
 .
 gcc and the C library headers are runtime dependencies because varnishd
 compiles each VCL program with the system toolchain at run time.

Package: varnish-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 varnish (= ${binary:Version}),
 pkgconf,
 python3,
Description: development files for Varnish Cache (matrix build)
 Headers, the varnishapi.pc pkg-config file, autoconf macros and generator
 tools needed to build a Varnish VMOD or an application against libvarnishapi.
 A VMOD is bound to the exact Varnish Cache build it was compiled against, so
 this package depends on the exact matching varnish binary version.
